Package: ldtprophet
Type: Project
Title: Apostles Prophet-ability Calculator
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Monte Carlo succession probabilities for apostles of The Church
    of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints. Imports are what run_all.R and
    scripts/export_to_json.R need (installed in CI by
    r-lib/actions/setup-r-dependencies); Suggests are for the Shiny app only.
    tests/test_workflow_packages.R checks Imports against the sources.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    jsonlite,
    MASS,
    readr,
    scales,
    stringr,
    tidyr
Suggests:
    bslib,
    glue,
    plotly,
    shiny
